{"id":"rata","lemma":"rata","pos":"adj","rank":1944,"glosses":["stingy, miserly, tight-fisted","rat, jerk (despicable person, especially who has been deceitful or disloyal)","rat, snitch, informant"],"ipa":"/ˈrata/","order":1978,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-rata.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es carne de rata.","en":"It's rat meat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799687","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"flesh"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Creo que huelo una rata.","en":"I think I smell a rat.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to smell","l":"oler"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Una rata cruzó la ruta.","en":"A rat ran across the road.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to cross","l":"cruzar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"highway"}]}]}